Yay! My first ascension - ElKeke, chaotic elven wizard!

I've been playing nethack now and then for about 6 years.
I've once gotten to the Medusa before - my best nethack result :)

I was really lucky this time; Found 4 or 5 bones with nice rings (ring
of slow digestion was important, I often die of hunger when playing
wizards).

Found +4 orcish helm on the start, it helped alot.

Altars on lvl 1 , 9 and 14.
Dwarf town had coaligned altar but was a difficult bone level (3 of my
chararacters died there, and left three bones).
This time, I survived.

Found AoLS early, and it saved my life when I was saccing monsters in
dwarftown temple (priest got into a flamming sphere explosion,
got angry and killed me)

I've charmed the priest later on and bought protection :)

I've managed to destroy 2 +5 CoMR an T-shirts in polymorph accidents
(I quaffed potion of polymorf (smoky potion)
believing I had polymorph control but I didn't; I don't know what
polymorphed me second time in Vlad's tower - wasn't a trap).

I couldn't find no more CoMR's so I ascended with a cloak of
displacement.

I rarely play wizards but now I've seen their power
(blasting stuff with magic missile, fireball and finger of death;
id-ing, polymorphing, digging and mapping with spells - powerful
stuff)

I was a bit worried when I lost cloak and shirt for second time, but i
managed to polypile enough enchant armors to get AC low enough
(to -42) (there was no magic markers in the game, I got the only one
by wishing)

I blasted through the Gehenom and the planes (I didn't know about AoY
magic draining powers so it
caused me some troubles on the elemental planes)

Second altar I visited was aligned (I'm glad I could avoid Death),
and I finally managed to knock on the heaven's door ;)

I have to rest now, and enjoy my accomplishment :)

